step Amulet of Secrets
  zone map 1432
  tip Magregan Deepshadow, a Dark Iron dwarf just outside the Uldaman instance portal, drops Hammertoe's Amulet. · Kill him, loot it and give it back to Hammertoe Grez (lying in the same outer cave). · ~3,150 XP.
  complete 722 "Amulet of Secrets" @38.3,94.0
  turnin 722 "Amulet of Secrets" npc 2909 "Hammertoe Grez" @37.3,85.8

step Tremors of the Earth
  zone map 1418
  tip Use the Sign of the Earth to activate the Pillars of Amethyst, Opal, and Diamond and obtain the Runestones. · Elite Lv 50 ogre: hold it and come back with a group. ~5,900 XP.
  complete 717 "Tremors of the Earth" @81.9,49.5
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

