step Agmond's Fate
  zone map 1432
  tip The 4 Carved Stone Urns are NOT at the dig site outside, even though the quest says so. · They're inside the Uldaman cave (the outer part, before the instance portal). · Click the urns on the ground. · ~2,850 XP. · Holy BiS: reward Restorer's Fine Gloves (Lv 40 hands).
  complete 704 "Agmond's Fate" @34.4,97.8
  turnin 704 "Agmond's Fate" @65.9,65.6

