step Uldaman Reagent Run
  zone map 1432
  tip The 12 Magenta Fungus Caps come from Magenta Cap Clusters (little pink mushroom clumps on the ground) in Uldaman, and the Stonevault troggs and Shadowforge dwarves inside drop them too. · Pick them up as you go. · ~3,450 XP.
  complete 17 "Uldaman Reagent Run" @33.8,98.2
  turnin 17 "Uldaman Reagent Run" @37.1,49.4

step The Hidden Chamber
  zone map 1418
  tip Read Baelog's Journal on the table next to him. · Open Baelog's Chest right there for the Gni'kiv Medallion. · Kill Revelosh (the trogg boss) for The Shaft of Tsol. · Combine them into the Staff of Prehistoria. · In the Map Chamber, use the staff on the pedestal to open the Chamber of Khaz'mul (that's where Ironaya is). · Walk in to complete it, then report to Prospector Stormpike in Ironforge.
  complete 2240 "The Hidden Chamber"
  turnin 2240 "The Hidden Chamber" npc 1356 "Prospector Stormpike" map 1455 @74.6,11.7

step The Shattered Necklace
  zone map 1418
  tip Search for the original creator of the shattered necklace to learn of its potential value. · Hand in: Talvash del Kissel, Ironforge (36.4, 3.6). ~3,300 XP.
  turnin 2198 "The Shattered Necklace" npc 6826 "Talvash del Kissel" map 1455 @36.4,3.7

step The Platinum Discs
  zone map 1418
  tip After you kill Archaedas (last boss), walk into the room behind him. · Talk to the stone watcher there and listen to all of it, then click the Discs of Norgannon. · That completes part 1 right away. · ~4,200 XP.
  complete 2278 "The Platinum Discs"
  turnin 2278 "The Platinum Discs"

