step The Platinum Discs
  zone map 1418
  tip Click the Discs of Norgannon again: a Miniature Platinum Discs item goes in your bags. · Take it to High Explorer Magellas in the Hall of Explorers, Ironforge. · ~5,250 XP.
  turnin 2279 "The Platinum Discs" npc 5387 "High Explorer Magellas" map 1455 @69.9,18.5

